<p>Changes to EU laws in 2011 mean that all UK websites which make use of cookies, must let users know that they are storing this data on their PC.</p>

<p>This website makes use of basic cookies to allow storing of login details and some Google Analytics to improve the service we offer.</p>

<p>For more information visit the <a href="http://www.ico.org.uk/for_organisations/privacy_and_electronic_communications/the_guide/cookies">Information Commissioner's Office</a>.</p>

